        "'Please address your enquiries to gdpr@etarget.sk', the mailbox "
        "already on this row. Mailbox-only, hence this bucket. ONE DEFECT "
        "WORTH RECORDING, because it is the kind of thing that looks like "
        "a missed surface: the policy's 'Opt-In and Opt-Out Mechanism' "
        "section says 'User can opt out here www.etarget.sk through the "
        "GDPR icon on the page' -- and there is no GDPR icon on that "
        "page, nor any other control, because etarget.sk now redirects to "
