        "this pass; finding it is a five-minute job for whoever picks this "
        "up, starting from the site's own footer.\n"
        "\n"
        "WORTH THE RECHECK RATHER THAN A WRITE-OFF, because of what this "
        "company is. L2 (Labels & Lists) is one of the largest commercial "
        "VOTER-FILE vendors in the United States: its records are built on "
        "state voter registration rolls, which are public records, "
        "enriched with consumer and modelled data and sold for political "
        "targeting. Two consequences for whoever writes this row up. First, "
