        "cmplz_datarequest_global_optout ('Global opt-out from selling "
        "and sharing my personal inf...'), "
        "cmplz_datarequest_cross_context ('Do not sell my personal "
        "information for cross-context b...'), "
        "cmplz_datarequest_limit_sensitive ('Limit the use of my "
        "sensitive personal information'), "
        "cmplz_datarequest_request_for_access, "
        "cmplz_datarequest_right_to_be_forgotten, "
        "cmplz_datarequest_right_to_data_portability; and submission is "
        "an input type=button named cmplz-datarequest-submit, i.e. AJAX, "
        "not a native submit. THE TRAP, and the reason a naive "
        "transcription would be flagged as a bot: "
        "cmplz_datarequest_firstname is a HONEYPOT. It is type=search, "
        "class dnsmpd-firstname, NOT required, and visually present, and "
        "it carries the SAME label text ('Name') as the real field -- "
        "Complianz's standard decoy. It must go in forbidden_selectors "
        "and be left empty. One unresolved item keeps this from being a "
        "clean recipe call: the consent snapshot lists "
        "cmplz_service_cleantalk-spam-protect, so CleanTalk server-side "
