    # dateOfBirthDSARElement AND nationalIdDSARElement ('SSN (Last 4
    # Digits Only)') AND a file upload on a US consumer-credit site, and
    # wrote it up here as blocked. That entry has been DELETED, because
    # credit-com already has a SHIPPED RECIPE in RECIPES, verified
    # 2026-09-22, which reaches the same page, records the same field set
