        "\n"
        "BLOCKED twice over, and the second reason is the important one:\n"
        "\n"
        "  1. reCAPTCHA v2 -- g-recaptcha-response textarea and a rendered "
        "     anchor frame showing the checkbox.\n"
        "  2. A REQUIRED FILE UPLOAD. vt-file-select-input-1 ('Select a "
        "     File') is marked REQUIRED on this tenant. This is the FIRST "
        "     mandatory instance in the whole sweep -- bolttech-io and "
        "     buyerlink-co both carry the same control as optional, where "
