        "\n"
        "Worth recording from the form's own text, because it is a "
        "genuinely unusual policy: 'Claritas will treat correction "
        "requests as a request to delete.' A consumer asking for an "
        "address to be fixed gets the record removed instead. Correction "
        "is routed to privacyinfo@claritas.com rather than this form.\n"
