        "    /assets/common/captcha/turnstile.html (sitekey visible in the "
        "    frame URL). Worth noting for any captcha detector: Turnstile "
        "    is served here from a FIRST-PARTY path, so matching on "
        "    challenges.cloudflare.com alone would miss it.\n"
        "  - EMAIL CONFIRMATION. The dataset records, and the flow name "
        "    'optOutLight/search' implies, a search-then-select-then-"
        "    confirm sequence finishing with a confirmation link sent by "
        "    email. This repo is SMTP-SEND-ONLY and deliberately has no "
        "    IMAP client, so it cannot read a confirmation link. That "
        "    second gate would block this row even if the captcha were "
