        "dsarwebform/3d2d5e0c-.../400f54ed-...html) titled 'Data Subject "
        "Access Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information Request'. The "
        "field set is the familiar OneTrust one and is fully mappable: "
        "firstNameDSARElement, lastNameDSARElement, emailDSARElement, "
        "phoneNumberDSARElement, countryDSARElement, addressDSARElement, "
        "formField16DSARElement (Address Line 2), cityDSARElement, "
        "stateDSARElement, zipDSARElement -- all required except line 2.\n"
        "\n"
        "BLOCKED, and by a captcha family not seen before in this sweep. "
        "There is no reCAPTCHA here at all. Instead the form carries "
        "OneTrust's built-in BotDetect image captcha: hidden "
        "BDC_VCID_angularBasicCaptcha, BDC_BackWorkaround_"
        "angularBasicCaptcha, BDC_Hs_angularBasicCaptcha and BDC_SP_"
        "angularBasicCaptcha, plus a typed input[name='captchaCode'] "
        "labelled 'Captcha'.\n"
        "\n"
        "This is the seventh OneTrust tenant read in this sweep (after "
        "koddi, gumgum, leidosiq, lusha, madisonlogic and the already- "
        "shipped bolttech-io) and it changes the "
        "requirement on the parked generic OneTrust handler: it must "
        "detect BotDetect as well as reCAPTCHA, and it must NOT infer "
        "'no captcha' from the absence of a g-recaptcha element. Element "
        "ids stay stable across tenants; captcha choice does not.\n"
        "\n"
        "The privacy policy also links a second OneTrust route under 'Do "
        "Not Sell or Share My Personal Information' (privacyportal."
        "onetrust.com/...), not probed this pass."
