    # wizard). These two are different and it is worth saying so up front:
    # they are PRIVACY TOOLS that got swept into a broker dataset. One is
    # a state regulator's platform, the other a nonprofit's junk-mail
    # service. They are filed here rather than as no-surface because
    # "this broker offers no opt-out" would be a false statement about
    # both -- offering opt-outs is the whole of what they do.
